---
import LandingPage from '../../layouts/LandingPage.astro';
import Section from '../../components/Section.astro';
import NumberedRows from '../../components/NumberedRows.astro';

const services = [
  { title: 'Technical SEO', text: 'Crawling, indexing, speed and architecture, tuned to hold up under nationwide search volume. The foundation Google and AI crawlers need to understand your site.' },
  { title: 'Content and on-page', text: 'Pages built around what people in Mexico actually search for, written so AI models can cite you.' },
  { title: 'Authority and link building', text: 'Quality links and mentions, several from Mexican media and directories, that build domain authority without shortcuts that end in a penalty.' },
  { title: 'Local SEO', text: 'Show up on Google Maps and in local AI answers across Mexico City, Monterrey, Guadalajara and the rest of the country.' },
  { title: 'GEO: visibility in AI', text: 'We optimize your brand so ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini and Google AI Overviews recommend you when someone asks for providers.' },
  { title: 'Measurement and reporting', text: 'Rankings, organic traffic and attributable revenue at the national level and by city. We report what moves the business, not vanity metrics.' },
];

const faqs = [
  { q: 'What does an SEO agency in Mexico do?', a: 'An SEO agency in Mexico audits your site, your market and your local competition, then runs a strategy so your business shows up when people search on Google from the country. At Clicroot we add GEO: we also optimize so ChatGPT, Perplexity and Google AI Overviews cite you, because more and more buyers ask AI before they search on Google.' },
  { q: 'Do you work across all of Mexico or only in Mexico City?', a: 'We work for the whole country. We serve businesses in Mexico City, Monterrey, Guadalajara and other markets, and we design the local strategy around where your customers are. SEO is run remotely, so your company location does not limit the reach.' },
  { q: 'What is GEO and why do you include it?', a: 'GEO (generative engine optimization) is the practice of optimizing your brand for AI search engines. At a national scale that means your brand entity is well described and cited when someone in any part of the country asks ChatGPT, Perplexity or Google AI Overviews for a provider. We work that layer alongside classic SEO.' },
  { q: 'SEO consultant or SEO agency: which is right for me in Mexico?', a: 'A large agency has more hands for high-volume execution; a consultant gives you senior judgment and focus. At Clicroot you work directly with the consultants who design the strategy, with no account manager in between. It is the balance between an agency’s muscle and a consultant’s closeness.' },
  { q: 'How much does SEO cost in Mexico?', a: 'It depends on the scope and how broad your market is: a campaign focused on one city does not cost the same as a strategy for several markets across the country. We work by project, audit or monthly engagement, with the scope agreed up front and no forced lock-in. Book a call and we will give you a clear range.' },
  { q: 'How long until I see results?', a: 'SEO compounds. Technical fixes and quick wins can move rankings within weeks. Generic national-reach terms are the most contested and take three to six months or more; terms tied to a specific city usually arrive sooner. We give you honest expectations from the first call.' },
];
---

<LandingPage
  id="mexico"
  lang="en"
  title="SEO Agency in Mexico + GEO | Clicroot"
  description="SEO agency in Mexico with senior consultants. Google rankings and AI visibility (GEO) for companies in Mexico City, Monterrey and Guadalajara. Book a call."
  kicker="SEO + GEO Agency · Mexico"
  h1="SEO Agency in Mexico"
  h1Accent="Mexico"
  lead="We position your brand on Google and in AI search engines, ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini and Google AI Overviews, with a strategy built for the volume and diversity of the Mexican market. You work directly with the senior consultants who design and execute the plan."
  crumbLabel="SEO Agency in Mexico"
  proofTitle="Clients in Mexico: leads per month"
  service={{
    serviceType: 'SEO Agency',
    name: 'SEO and GEO Agency in Mexico',
    areaServed: 'Mexico',
    description: 'SEO agency in Mexico with senior consultants. Google rankings and visibility in AI search engines (GEO) for companies in Mexico City, Monterrey and Guadalajara.',
  }}
  faqs={faqs}
  faqTitle="Questions about SEO in Mexico."
>
  <Section tone="paper" title="What is an SEO agency in Mexico?" id="que-es" narrow>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>It is the one that connects three fronts into a single strategy: the technical side of the site, the content that answers searcher intent and the authority that makes you trustworthy in Google’s eyes. At Clicroot we add a fourth front, GEO, so your brand also shows up when artificial intelligence answers. Today many buying journeys start with a question to ChatGPT instead of a traditional list of results, and that is a channel we work from day one.</p>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section tone="ink" title="SEO and GEO, from the technical layer to AI.">
    <NumberedRows items={services} cols={3} />
  </Section>
</LandingPage>
